<body>
<br>
<p style="font-size:15px">
<h4><b>STEP 1</b></h4>
Please select the year(s), species, continent, region and country(s) for which you are interested in obtaining an estimate. In each drop down menu, you can choose multiple options or select all.
<br><br>
Based on your selection, a population prediction will be made for each year, species and country combination. Details about the methodology for this are described in the Parameters section. 
<br><br>
If you have your own data, you can insert it into the table by selecting the “Edit Values” button. Once you have completed entering your data, please click “Save values”.
<br><br>
The table is automatically generated and presents predicted values with confidence intervals (CI). The column titled “Prediction” describes if the model was able to predict a value or if the most recent FAOSTAT value has been used (for more details about this calculation please see the “Parameters” section).<br><br>
<br>
